    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Was that door always open? Or is something peeking out from inside the closet? Is that breathing yours or is that just\u00a0the demon under the bed waiting for you to close your eyes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go To Sleep</strong>\u00a0is a short first-person point-and-click survival horror game where you play as a young teen trapped in a dream-turned-nightmare. Stuck in his bedroom, you must survive until morning keeping a relentless demon at bay with your only source of support being a tiny stuffed companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/ef6ce2dbf03f4dcd74c3bc03d70a8aab.poster.avif?t=1754009425\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/ef6ce2dbf03f4dcd74c3bc03d70a8aab.webm?t=1754009425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/ef6ce2dbf03f4dcd74c3bc03d70a8aab.mp4?t=1754009425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it until the morning?</p>",
